<reference id="tagdictionary-HistoryMarkerTag" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">tagdictionary-HistoryMarkerTag</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">The <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">historyMarker</parmname> tag is available
in the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">tagdictionary</wintitle> palette under the <filepath class="+ topic/ph sw-d/filepath ">Smart Tags</filepath> folder.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">historyMarker<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">smart tag</indexterm></indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">The <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">historyMarker</parmname> smart tag, if included
in a rule, is a marker tag that is applied to a <codeph class="+ topic/ph pr-d/codeph ">control:ControlPoint</codeph> object if it has an enabled history extension.<image placement="break" scale="75" scope="local" width="500" href="../graphic/historymarker_0000038906.png" class="- topic/image "/></p></section></refbody></reference>